Hi Bruce,
You're on the right track, but you don't have to dig into the Pmatrix
slots. For a full example, see page 167 (yes, really) of the appendices to
our IPM guide (Merow, C., J. P. Dahlgren, C. J. E. Metcalf, D. Z. Childs,
M. E. K. Evans, E. Jongejans, S. Record, M. Rees, R. Salguero-G?mez, and S.
M. Mcmahon. 2014. Advancing population ecology with integral projection
models: a practical guide. Methods in Ecology and Evolution 5:99?110.)
Cory

